    <desc lang="en">The invincible lawyer NGO PAK-YIN (Moses Chan) thinks his proficiency in legal knowledge enables him to have it all including living a fulfilling life with his beloved wife TSANG PO-LAM (Maggie Shiu). His world comes crashing down when infidelity occurs due to the irreconcilable differences between the couple! PAK-YIN is now a law firm partner, however, when he was young, he and his younger brother NGO PAK-WANG (Brian Chu) were in a fit of desperation resulting in him aspiring to climb the social ladder and gain more power. To achieve his goals, PAK-YIN, who is adept at bringing everything under his control, does whatever he wants to do regardless of the feelings of the others. Seeing how he has changed, his supportive wife PO-LAM and loyal brother PAK-WANG start feeling estranged from him. Later, PO-LAM's mother passes away leaving her devastated, and at that time, LUI WING-HANG (Ben Wong) who stands by her side manages to penetrate her heart. WING-HANG is also a lawyer, but he is no match for PAK-YIN in terms of social status and class. Nonetheless, he is able to satisfy PO-LAM's emotional needs. Since then, the NGO family has been full of suspicion and lies, so PO-LAM decides to leave but gets attacked out of the blue, which makes her suspect that her husband must be behind the whole thing! Thus PAK-YIN is plunged into the depth of despair...... For the sake of true love, PAK-YIN is determined to put his life back together, listening to his heart to recover what he has lost.</desc>
